  "name": "Mesh Finishing - WTiVo, Simplify and Rebake",
  "description": "Local small-hole repair at R64 preserves eligible original surfaces and keeps all source components (drop 0). Before Run, choose the input GLB in Load 3D Mesh and a paired intact original textured HIGH in UV / Repack + Rebake. Inspect measures the repaired geometry; Simplify is a byte-preserving no-op below the 80,000-triangle ceiling. The moderate rebake uses 512 px with unchanged strict geometry and projection limits. New faces have no authored appearance: without a valid matching HIGH counterpart the job may refuse. Full Volume remains a separate explicit option on the reconstruction node. Requires the separately configured optional WTiVo runtime; this preset is not universal hole closure or texture equivalence.",
